{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "eb0f663d-6a95-4f28-bc22-52a3a7669590",
    "name": "📌 Nebius AI API",
    "description": "### About\n\n\"Build and scale faster on the purpose-built AI cloud, engineered from silicon to API.\"\n\nNebius runs open models from other labs, such as DeepSeek, Qwen and GLM, through OpenAI-compatible Chat and Responses APIs. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Inference hosts**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- Nebius AI Account: [https://tokenfactory.nebius.com/](https://tokenfactory.nebius.com/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `nebius_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:nebius_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/quickstart](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/quickstart)\n    \n- Models: [https://tokenfactory.nebius.com/](https://tokenfactory.nebius.com/)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2025-02-16T17:15:51.000Z",
